tion: absolute; top: 0px; left: 0px; right: 0px; transform: translateY(1728px); padding-bottom: 16px;"><div class="group/inj relative"><div class="bg-card group relative flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[14px] ring-1 transition-[transform,box-shadow] duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:ring-2 ring-primary"><div class="relative block"><div class="relative overflow-hidden aspect-[16/9] w-full rounded-none" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgb(59, 7, 100), rgb(236, 72, 153));"><img alt="" class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover" src="./newsub_files/019f23cd-5db0-7000-bc94-8fde4ce9bd14_display_lg.webp"></div><div class="absolute bottom-3 left-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md border px-2 py-1 text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-[0.08em] uppercase border-primary/35 bg-primary/[0.1] text-primary !border-white/20 !bg-black/55 backdrop-blur-md"><span class="relative inline-flex h-1.5 w-1.5"><span class="absolute inset-0 animate-ping rounded-full opacity-60 bg-primary"></span><span class="relative inline-flex h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary"></span></span>Voting live</span></div></div><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-4"><div class="mb-2 flex min-w-0 items-center justify-between gap-2"><span class="text-foreground/60 min-w-0 truncate text-[12px]">by <span class="text-foreground font-semibold">@kyle</span></span></div><a href="https://kre8or.ai/challenges/019f23cf-3792-7dfe-b85d-40415d2cbe2a" class="hover:text-primary line-clamp-1 text-[16px] font-semibold tracking-tight transition-colors after:absolute after:inset-0 after:content-[&#39;&#39;]">Invent an Ice Cream That Has Never Existed</a><p class="text-foreground/55 mt-1 line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.6em] text-[12.5px] leading-[1.3]">Ice cream has been around for centuries, and somehow we keep landing on the same dozen flavors. This week, invent one that has never existed. · Not a twist on vanilla. Not chocolate with a new name. A genuinely new ice cream, flavor and all, that nobody has ever scooped before. You are the inventor and the brand. Dream up the flavor, then design the packaging it would sit in on a freezer shelf, whether that is a pint, a tub, a bar wrapper, a cart, or whatever it lives in. · Think about things like what the flavor actually is and what is in it, the name you would put on the label, and the personality the brand gives off, whether that is playful, premium, weird, nostalgic, or luxurious. Think about the colors, the typography, and the textures, and whether the packaging makes someone want to grab it before they even know what it tastes like. Think about how you present it, sitting in a freezer, melting on a cone, styled in a clean studio shot, or out in the world. · Half the fun is the flavor nobody asked for. The other half is making it look like something that belongs in the premium aisle.</p><div class="border-divider mt-auto grid grid-cols-[1.4fr_0.8fr_0.8fr] gap-3 border-t pt-3.5"><div><span class="text-foreground/55 text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-[0.1em] uppercase">Prize pool</span><div class="mt-1 text-[18px] font-semibold tabular-nums"><span class="text-accent tabular-nums drop-shadow-[0_0_18px_hsl(var(--accent)/0.3)]">$315</span></div><div class="text-foreground/45 text-[11px] tabular-nums">70K CR</div></div><div><span class="text-foreground/55 text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-[0.1em] uppercase">Entries</span><div class="mt-1 text-[15px] font-semibold tabular-nums">80</div></div><div><span class="text-foreground/55 text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-[0.1em] uppercase">Time left</span><div class="mt-1 text-[15px] font-semibold text-primary">2d 3h</div></div></div><div class="mt-3.5 grid"><a href="https://kre8or.ai/challenges/019f23cf-3792-7dfe-b85d-40415d2cbe2a/vote" class="relative z-10 inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-[10px] px-4 py-2.5 text-[13px] font-semibold transition-colors active:scale-[0.98] bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/90">Vote now <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><button type="button" aria-label="Not interested" title="Not interested" class="absolute top-3 right-3 z-10 grid h-6 w-6 cursor-pointer place-items-center rounded-full bg-black/45 text-white/70 backdrop-blur-md transition-colors hover:bg-black/70 hover:text-white"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-x h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 6 6 18"></path><path d="m6 6 12 12"></path></svg></button></div></div><div data-index="4" style="position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 0px; right: 0px; transform: translateY(2195px); padding-bottom: 16px;"><div class="group overflow-hidden transition-shadow duration-500 bg-card border-border rounded-none border-b shadow-sm md:rounded-2xl md:border md:shadow-sm"><div class="relative"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-2"><a href="https://kre8or.ai/profile/jdenesovych" class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1.5 transition-opacity hover:opacity-80"><span class="relative flex overflow-hidden rounded-full h-5 w-5 shrink-0"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aspect-square h-full w-full" alt="Jeremy Denesovych" src="./newsub_files/avatar_sm(7).webp"></span><span class="text-muted-foreground truncate text-xs font-medium">@jdenesovych</span></a><span class="text-muted-foreground shrink-0 text-xs whitespace-nowrap">9h ago</span><span class="ml-auto flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1.5"><div tabindex="0"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap font-medium cursor-pointer transition-all foc