 d="M19 14v4"></path><path d="M10 2v2"></path><path d="M7 8H3"></path><path d="M21 16h-4"></path><path d="M11 3H9"></path></svg><span class="whitespace-nowrap">Technique</span></button></div><textarea class="border-input ring-offset-background placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus-visible:ring-ring flex field-sizing-content w-full py-2 text-base focus-visible:outline-none disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 md:text-sm [field-sizing:content] min-h-[80px] shrink-0 resize-none rounded-none border-0 bg-transparent px-4 focus-visible:ring-0 focus-visible:ring-offset-0 md:[field-sizing:fixed] md:min-h-[180px] md:flex-1 md:shrink md:overflow-y-auto" placeholder="Enter a prompt to start creating...">​Prompt: A subtle and realistic background image for an educational website. Close-up macro photography of a stack of high-quality textured parchment paper and closed hardcover books. Faint warm desk lamp lighting casting soft shadows. Elegant, professional, and understated, with muted beige, gold, and dark blue tones. Very shallow depth of field, creating a smooth, non-distracting background with ample empty space for text overlays. 16:9 aspect ratio, photorealistic.</textarea><div class="space-y-2 px-4"></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2"><button type="button" class="flex flex-1 flex-col items-center gap-0.5 rounded-lg border py-1.5 text-xs font-medium transition-colors border-primary/50 bg-primary/10 text-primary"><span class="flex items-center gap-1">Standard</span><span class="text-[10px] opacity-60">512px</span></button><button type="button" class="flex flex-1 flex-col items-center gap-0.5 rounded-lg border py-1.5 text-xs font-medium transition-colors border-border/50 text-muted-foreground hover:border-primary/30 hover:text-foreground"><span class="flex items-center gap-1">Med<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linej